  "decision_conditions": [
    "Insufficient information has been provided to demonstrate that the existing access is of adequate width to allow safe vehicle movement and safe pedestrian access to/from the application site and No 14 Westfield Road, that the proposed parking space is of an adequate site to accommodate an average size modern car and it would not compromise safety and access of occupiers at No 14 Westfield Road entering/exiting their property and rear garden/bicycle storage and would not obstruct/compromise the existing car parking space at No 13 Westfield Road. As such it has not been demonstrated that the proposal would not result in adverse impact on highway safety, contrary to Paragraph 116 of the NPPF, 2024 and Policies DM9 and DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012."
  ],
